{
  "title": "S3 Storage Classes · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "객체의 접근 빈도와 복원 시간에 맞춘 저장 등급이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Storage Classes</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-standard\">S3 Standard</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\">S3 Intelligent-Tiering</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-standard-ia\">S3 Standard-IA</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-one-zone-ia\">S3 One Zone-IA</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-instant-retrieval\">S3 Glacier Instant Retrieval</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-flexible-retrieval\">S3 Glacier Flexible Retrieval</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-deep-archive\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-express-one-zone\">S3 Express One Zone</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-on-outposts\">S3 on Outposts</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reduced-redundancy-storage\">Reduced Redundancy Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#lifecycle-and-restore\">Lifecycle and Restore</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>46 / 62</span></div><h1>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Storage Classes</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 11 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Storage Class는 접근 빈도·즉시 조회 필요성·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 복원력·Object 크기·보관 기간에 따라 선택한다. 낮은 Storage 단가만 보고 Retrieval·Transition·조기 삭제 비용을 빼면 전체 비용이 더 커질 수 있다.</p><p>Online Class는 Object를 바로 읽을 수 있지만 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-flexible-retrieval\">Glacier Flexible Retrieval</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-deep-archive\">Deep Archive</a>는 일반적으로 Restore 후 접근한다. 복구 시간 요구가 있는 문제에서 이 차이가 우선 선택 기준이다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"즉시 읽기와 Restore\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>즉시 읽기와 Restore</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Online retrieval</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Frequent / Infrequent</strong><small>접근 빈도 판단</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Standard / IA <span class=\"full-name\">(Infrequent Access)</span> / Glacier Instant</strong><small>즉시 읽기 Class</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>GET Object</strong><small>Retrieval·최소 보관 비용 확인</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Archive retrieval</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Long retention</strong><small>복원 대기 허용</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Glacier Flexible / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-deep-archive\">Deep Archive</a></strong><small>Archive 저장</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Restore → GET</strong><small>복구 시간과 임시 Copy 비용</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\">Intelligent-Tiering</a>의 선택 Archive Tier도 활성화 여부·복원 조건을 확인한다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Class</th><th scope=\"col\">Access</th><th scope=\"col\">AZ model</th><th scope=\"col\">Primary trade-off</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Standard</td><td>즉시</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a></td><td>빈번한 읽기</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\">Intelligent-Tiering</a></td><td>기본 Online / 선택 Archive</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a></td><td>Monitoring·Tier 조건</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-standard-ia\">Standard-IA</a></td><td>즉시</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a></td><td>Retrieval·30일</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-one-zone-ia\">One Zone-IA</a></td><td>즉시</td><td>One <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 손실 위험·30일</td></tr><tr><td>Glacier Instant</td><td>즉시</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a></td><td>Retrieval·90일</td></tr><tr><td>Glacier Flexible</td><td>Restore</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a></td><td>복원 지연·90일</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-deep-archive\">Deep Archive</a></td><td>Restore</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a></td><td>긴 복원 지연·180일</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-express-one-zone\">Express One Zone</a></td><td>즉시</td><td>One <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></td><td>전용 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a> 모델</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"s3-standard\"><h2>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Standard<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-standard\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>빈번한 접근과 낮은 지연에 적합한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> Class다. 접근 패턴이 알려지지 않은 일반 Object의 시작점으로 사용한다. Retrieval 비용 때문에 자주 읽는 데이터를 IA <span class=\"full-name\">(Infrequent Access)</span>로 옮기는 것이 언제나 더 싼 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"s3-intelligent-tiering\"><h2>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Intelligent-Tiering<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>접근 패턴에 따라 자동 Tier 이동을 관리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\">Frequent Access</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\">Infrequent Access</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\">Archive Instant Access</a>가 Online Tier이고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\">Archive Access</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\">Deep Archive Access</a>는 선택 활성화하는 비동기 Tier다. Object별 Monitoring 비용과 작은 Object의 자동 Tiering 조건을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"s3-standard-ia\"><h2>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Standard-IA <span class=\"full-name\">(Infrequent Access)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-standard-ia\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>드물게 읽지만 즉시 읽어야 하는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> 데이터에 사용한다. Retrieval 과금과 최소 보관 기간·최소 청구 Object 크기가 있다. 한 달 안에 자주 바뀌는 작은 File에 무조건 적합하지 않다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"s3-one-zone-ia\"><h2>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> One Zone-IA <span class=\"full-name\">(Infrequent Access)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-one-zone-ia\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 저장해 비용을 낮추는 IA <span class=\"full-name\">(Infrequent Access)</span> Class다. 재생성 가능한 데이터나 다른 곳의 복제본에 적합하다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 전체 손실을 견뎌야 하는 유일한 원본의 보관에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> Class와 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"s3-glacier-instant-retrieval\"><h2>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Glacier Instant Retrieval<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-instant-retrieval\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>드문 접근에 낮은 지연의 즉시 읽기를 제공하는 Archive Class다. Retrieval 비용과 더 긴 최소 보관 기간을 고려한다. 이름에 Glacier가 있어도 Flexible Retrieval처럼 모든 요청 전에 Restore가 필요한 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"s3-glacier-flexible-retrieval\"><h2>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Glacier Flexible Retrieval<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-flexible-retrieval\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Archive Object를 Restore한 뒤 읽으며 Expedited·Standard·Bulk 방식에 따라 지연·비용이 달라진다. 임시 복원 Copy의 보관 기간도 지정한다. 즉시 사용자 다운로드가 필수인 데이터에는 Restore 대기 시간이 문제가 된다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"s3-glacier-deep-archive\"><h2>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Glacier Deep Archive<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-deep-archive\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>매우 드문 접근과 긴 보관에 맞는 Archive Class다. Standard·Bulk Restore는 수시간 이상의 지연을 고려한다. 저렴한 Storage 비용 대신 긴 최소 보관·복원 시간·Retrieval 비용을 수용해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"s3-express-one-zone\"><h2>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Express One Zone<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-express-one-zone\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#directory-buckets-and-s3-express-one-zone\">Directory Bucket</a>에서 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 낮은 지연을 제공한다. 반복적인 고성능 처리에 적합하지만 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> 저장과 동일한 장애 범위가 아니다. General Purpose <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>의 모든 기능을 그대로 지원한다고 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"s3-on-outposts\"><h2>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> on Outposts<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-on-outposts\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Outposts 환경에 Object를 저장하는 별도 Storage Class다. Local 데이터 위치·연결·용량 요구를 위해 사용한다. 일반 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>의 무제한 확장 모델과 지원 기능을 그대로 적용하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"reduced-redundancy-storage\"><h2>Reduced Redundancy Storage<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reduced-redundancy-storage\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>기존 RRS는 남아 있는 이전 세대 선택지다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>는 일반적으로 Standard 사용을 권장한다. 신규 설계에서 이름만 보고 최신 저비용 Class보다 유리한 대안으로 선택하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"lifecycle-and-restore\"><h2>Lifecycle and Restore<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#lifecycle-and-restore\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Transition은 저장 Class를 바꾸고 Restore는 Archive Object의 접근 가능한 Copy를 만드는 작업이다. Class별 최소 보관 기간은 대표적으로 IA <span class=\"full-name\">(Infrequent Access)</span> 30일, Glacier Instant·Flexible 90일, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-deep-archive\">Deep Archive</a> 180일이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\">Intelligent-Tiering</a>은 별도 과금·Tier 조건을 적용하므로 같은 조기 삭제 표를 그대로 사용하지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>매일 제공하는 이미지에는 Standard, 접근 빈도를 예측하기 어려운 큰 Archive에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\">Intelligent-Tiering</a>, 7년 보존하고 다음 날 복원이 가능한 감사 자료에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-deep-archive\">Deep Archive</a>를 비교한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>최소 보관 기간·검색 비용·복원 지연·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 범위를 함께 확인한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/storage-class-intro.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonS3/latest/userguide/storage-class-intro.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q042/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q042\" data-question=\"Q042\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q042</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q042/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Compliance records will rarely be accessed for years, and long retrieval times are acceptable. Which storage class is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q042\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q042\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Standard</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q042\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EFS Standard</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q042\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-deep-archive\">Deep Archive</a>는 장기 보관과 느린 복원 허용에 맞는다. 최소 보관 기간과 검색 요금도 검토한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">S3 Storage Classes</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q043\" data-question=\"Q043\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q043</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q043/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application cannot predict how often its S3 objects will be accessed. Which storage class automatically moves objects among access tiers?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q043\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q043\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Intelligent-Tiering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q043\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS io2</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q043\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 One Zone-IA only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\">Intelligent-Tiering</a>은 접근 변화에 따라 적합한 계층으로 객체를 이동한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">S3 Storage Classes</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q085\" data-question=\"Q085\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1,3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q085</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q085/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO S3 features help protect against accidental deletion and manage long-term retention?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q085\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A fixed Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q085\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q085\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow all traffic in a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q085\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Lifecycle or retention policies</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q085\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">An RDS read replica</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B, D</strong> · 이전 버전을 유지하고 접근 패턴·보존 기간에 맞춰 수명 주기를 설정한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">S3 Storage Classes</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q095\" data-question=\"Q095\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q095</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q095/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Backup objects are retrieved immediately a few times per year and must survive the loss of one AZ. Which storage class is suitable?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q095\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">EC2 instance store</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q095\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Standard-IA</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q095\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q095\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 One Zone-IA</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-standard-ia\">Standard-IA</a>는 드문 접근이지만 빠른 조회가 가능하며 다중 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 저장을 제공한다. 최소 기간·검색 비용도 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">S3 Storage Classes</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q049\" data-question=\"Q049\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q049</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q049/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises application expects an SMB file share, while new files must be stored as objects in S3. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An RDS read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 온프레미스 파일 인터페이스와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체 저장을 연결한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">이전 용어 <b>S3</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">다음 용어 <b>Secrets Manager</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
